        "text": "Page: Užupis. Sentence: The district has been popular with artists for some time, and has been compared to Montmartre in Paris and to Freetown Christiania in Copenhagen, due to its bohemic and laissez-faire atmosphere.\nPage: Freetown Christiania. Sentence: It was temporarily closed by residents in April 2011 while discussions continued with the Danish government about its future, but then re-opened to the public.\nPage: Belmontas. Sentence: It is located in the area of Rasos, on the right bank of Vilnia River, to the east of Užupis.",
